<Base title="A business built around protecting water. | Watercana"><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Who we are</div><h1>A business built around protecting water.</h1><p>Conservation with every sip.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><p class="lead">Watercana is a Kenyan bottled water social enterprise founded on a simple conviction: protecting water sources is inseparable from providing clean water.</p><p class="lead">Our model combines water sales with a commitment to reinvest 20% of net profits into spring conservation and environmental education.</p><p class="lead">We aspire to protect spring catchment areas over the long term through land stewardship, indigenous reforestation and community partnerships.</p><a class="btn dark" href="/contact/">Connect with us</a></div><img src="/images/spring-landscape.svg" alt="Illustration of a spring landscape"/></div></section><section class="cta"><div class="wrap"><h2>Follow our conservation journey</h2><p>Updates and stories from Watercana.</p><a class="btn" href="/journal/">Read the journal</a></div></section></Base>